OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fcoastal showers, otherwise dry, mainly
OL,7,Fclear and also chilly with isolated
OL,8,Ffrost patches possible. Later heavy
OL,9,Fshowers reach Kent, perhaps extending
OL,10,Fslightly further west. Breezy along
OL,11,Fnorthern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,14,Frain across Kent gradually spread
OL,15,Fwestwards through the afternoon,
OL,16,Fturning heavy at times, although
OL,17,Fpredominantly across Kent. Feeling
OL,18,Frather cool. Windy along the Kent
OL,19,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
